        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9624ac16-2076-4a9e-8fed-cc363172e193\",\"review_text\":\"It good\"},{\"review_id\":\"b5048729-d172-476c-a415-bbc9b5b0bc3a\",\"review_text\":\"U cannot play the song u like. If u press a song it plays another song.i cannot even play my own playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"becd24a0-470c-44f7-b210-c8ed10fc281c\",\"review_text\":\"App is good but you should provide with lyrics for the new songs and why the hell this app shows no internet connection even though when I'm connected with the internet.my internet work's fine but not in this app..\"},{\"review_id\":\"ac3de4d6-dbe5-496b-a727-719bd83e0c02\",\"review_text\":\"Number Login Problem This Reason Spotify Get 1 Star Please Solved The Problem\"},{\"review_id\":\"8620a382-f387-429d-b54e-0ea6e38dbdaf\",\"review_text\":\"Noni dhima.442\"},{\"review_id\":\"597a0d80-1121-445b-a6bf-ae92752bfefd\",\"review_text\":\"What the hell is going on. Play one song at start up and then nothing for 5-10 minutes. C'mon Spotify.\"},{\"review_id\":\"1c83a8d6-ad36-4de6-9bcf-71bf17890712\",\"review_text\":\"Why I rate Spotify 5 stars because I can listen to music like YouTube premium free\"},{\"review_id\":\"79e45816-5f50-461a-8af5-35e07166c5f8\",\"review_text\":\"It's a nice app to play songs... But since I open this app everything is wrong and when I restart it...it's just the same thing so pls fixe this app just 🙏🙏🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"92ee567d-0aea-4628-887e-9050a11ae160\",\"review_text\":\"This app is really cool and quite efficient too.\"},{\"review_id\":\"136694b2-c8b5-4d19-852d-825e771dfef0\",\"review_text\":\"I just luv Spotify.The sound quality is great and the large amont of music available is absolutely breathtaking. I have tried the rest,Spotify is exactly what I need and at a very fair price.It is simply the best.\"}]}"
